WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:02.635
Welcome to the Stever House model room.

2
00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:06.773
So you may have noticed that
we swipe our CMU IDs to enter the room

3
00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:10.143
and then we are going to be punching
in four digit security code

4
00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.478
to actually get in.

5
00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:14.748
This ensures your safety
while you live on campus.

6
00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.950
The room that you see
here is a traditional double

7
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.686
and it comes fully furnished
with everything that you see here.

8
00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:23.456
You can also bring a mini fridge
or a microwave, but that is not required.

9
00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.692
As for roommates,
you can select between 10

10
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.662
to 20 housing options that you rank
on the housing portal website,

11
00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.931
and you can find your roommate
through a portal

12
00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.700
where you list your lifestyle habits

13
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.404
or you can leave it up to random chance
or social media to match with people.

14
00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:40.006
Of course,
we also are accessibility friendly

15
00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:42.142
so we can submit any accommodations

16
00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:46.012
for any sort of housing accommodations
that you need before you enroll.

17
00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:49.382
And the deadline for
that is usually the end of May.

